Fixes the tap-to-talk gesture, which did nothing at all in the last build.

With the microphone mode set to push to talk, switching the gesture on had no effect and nothing said so. The two now exclude each other visibly.

Also: the microphone icon showed open while the microphone was closed, and a recording started while connected came out empty.

Diagnostics has a new Motion section — sensor rate, and why a tap was rejected. Please look there if a tap does nothing.
